{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-research","title":"工程研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research","introMarkdown":"# 工程研究方法 简介\n\n工程研究与自然科学研究有一个根本性区别：工程不仅要理解世界，更要改造世界。博士阶段的工程研究者面临的核心挑战是在\"发现知识\"和\"创造产品\"之间架设桥梁——用系统化的方法将科学原理转化为可靠的技术方案，用优化和仿真工具在虚拟空间中验证设计，最终通过技术转移将实验室成果推向实际应用。\n\n本专题围绕工程研究的三个核心维度展开，覆盖从方法论到工具再到落地的完整链路。\n\n第一章**系统工程方法论**聚焦工程研究的思维框架。从需求分析到架构设计，从系统建模到验证确认，系统工程提供了一套管理复杂工程项目的结构化方法。本章涵盖基于模型的系统工程、需求工程与可追溯性、以及系统验证与确认的完整框架。\n\n第二章**优化与仿真**探讨工程设计的核心计算工具。多目标优化在相互冲突的设计指标之间寻找最优折中，有限元分析将连续物理场离散为可计算的代数方程组，数字孪生将物理系统映射到虚拟空间实现实时监控和预测性维护。这些工具使工程师能在制造实物之前充分探索设计空间。\n\n第三章**技术转移与产业化**处理从实验室到市场的\"最后一公里\"。技术成熟度评估提供了量化技术就绪程度的框架，知识产权策略保护创新成果的商业价值，产学研协同模式则探讨如何在学术自由与产业需求之间建立可持续的合作关系。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习：方法论提供思维框架，优化仿真提供技术手段，技术转移提供落地路径。三者构成工程博士的完整能力模型。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"systems-methodology","title":"系统工程方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/systems-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-based-systems-engineering","title":"博士阶段 工程研究方法 — 基于模型的系统工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/systems-methodology/model-based-systems-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"requirements-engineering-and-traceability","title":"博士工程研究 — 需求工程与可追溯性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/systems-methodology/requirements-engineering-and-traceability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-verification-and-validation","title":"博士工程研究 — 系统验证与确认","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/systems-methodology/system-verification-and-validation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-simulation","title":"优化与仿真","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/optimization-simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-objective-optimization","title":"博士工程研究 — 多目标优化与设计空间探索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/optimization-simulation/multi-objective-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finite-element-analysis","title":"博士工程研究 — 有限元分析与计算工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/optimization-simulation/finite-element-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-twins-and-virtual-verification","title":"博士工程研究 — 数字孪生与虚拟验证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/optimization-simulation/digital-twins-and-virtual-verification"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-transfer","title":"技术转移与产业化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/technology-transfer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technology-readiness-assessment","title":"博士工程研究 — 技术成熟度评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/technology-transfer/technology-readiness-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intellectual-property-and-innovation","title":"博士工程研究 — 知识产权与创新保护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/technology-transfer/intellectual-property-and-innovation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"industry-academia-collaboration","title":"博士工程研究 — 产学合作与工程创业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/engineering/engineering-research/technology-transfer/industry-academia-collaboration"}]}]}